OL,3,GNEWSABeach closure as Motocross circuit
OL,4,Areturns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stretch of beach at a seaside resort
OL,7,Fis set to close for the weekend as its
OL,8,Fsands are transformed into a motocross
OL,9,Frace circuit.
OL,11,FWeymouth Beach Motocross will take
OL,12,Fplace along about a mile (1.6km) of
OL,13,Fbeach from the Pavilion end of the
OL,14,FDorset town's beach to the Jubilee
OL,15,FClock.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
