OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABeach closure as Motocross circuit
OL,4,Areturns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe circuit, with a series of ramps,
OL,7,Fwill be built by diggers on Saturday
OL,8,Fmorning ready for race day on Sunday.
OL,9,FThe beach will be cordoned off from the
OL,10,FPavilion steps to the Jubilee Clock
OL,11,Ffrom 08:00 (BST) Saturday until about
OL,12,F20:00 Sunday.
OL,14,FThroughout Saturday afternoon there
OL,15,Fwill be motocross demonstrations on the
OL,16,Fbeach. On Sunday practicing starts from
OL,17,F11:30 with the main competitive beach
OL,18,Fracing from 13:00.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
